#: ../doc/timeline.rst:157
msgid "Single-click a keyframe on a clip or in the keyframe panel to select it and move the playhead to its frame. This leaves the Properties dock open or closed as you have arranged it. Double-click the keyframe, or right-click it and choose :guilabel:`Properties`, to open the dock."
